{"author":"scual.project@gmail.com","body":"Implemented on branch spec/215ee3-sync-safety. Deviation: warning text ends '(ti undelete <short> to bring it back)' instead of 'to restore' because CONTEXT.md reserves 'restore' for backups. ti pull --json (fork import) also carries warnings. Operations count as landed when they outrank the del op by (lamport, id); comments and set members count whenever they arrive."}